// f-jit: a run-time bind that fuses exactly LINK_BATCH (256) regions never links them
// Command: timeout -s KILL 60 graphix --no-cache f-jit-runtime-bind-batch-unlinked.gx
// Expected: the sum prints (the 254-let variant, 255 regions, prints 33401 and runs on)
// Observed: thread 'graphix-runtime' panicked at graphix-compiler/src/fusion/emit/jit.rs:965:9:
//           a kernel runs after its fusion pass links
// Cause: fuse_instance links only when `unlinked() > 0`; the 256th region moved every
// pending wrapper into the in-flight batch, so unlinked() is 0 and the batch never installs.
